  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting institutions and communities building an inclusive society in Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to support integration and social cohesion in Kosovo through enhancing capacities of central institutions to: provide learning of official languages at University and high-school level, support the process for verification of University and high-school diplomas, develop a mechanism to support monitoring of the implementation of communities-focussed legislation and support the government in addressing issues.</narrative>
  </description>
